filters compartment_id, display_name, id; Adopt
only a unique managed-list match in the
requested compartment.
conflicts: none
open gaps: none
Live CIDR-list create, item/description update,
and confirmed delete established the lifecycle
and mutation contract without enabling any Cloud
Guard detector or target.
`CREATING` and `UPDATING` requeue, `ACTIVE`
